      "text": "[7:55PM] #IkoroduRoad #Ikorodu #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is quite slow from Irawo through Ajegunle to Itowolo due to a failing expansion joint there. \n\nTraffic leaving the spot ti Majidun, Ogolonto inwards Auntie Keny and Agric is good.\n\nOur Men are strategically positioned to ensure traffic is smooth.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
